title: "Purrtine first run: from Welcome to Home"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: onboarding
    lg1: saving
    lg2: home
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 teal
  s0: Welcome
  s1: Notifications
  s2: Your first cat
  s3: Starter tasks
  s4: Saving your first cat
  s5: Starter tasks: Couldn't save alert
  s6: Home with the first cat
  s7: Home with no cat
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you tap Continue
  s1 --> s2: you allow notifications or you don't allow notifications or you skip notifications
  s2 --> s3: you skip the cat or you name the cat and tap Continue
  s3 --> s4: you tap Start
  s4 --> s0: the app is killed and opened again
  s4 --> s5: the save fails
  s4 --> s7: onboarding ends with no cat (name left empty) or the app is killed and opened again
  s4 --> s6: the cat and tasks are written or the app is killed and opened again or reminders are set up
  s5 --> s0: the app is killed and opened again
  s5 --> s4: you tap Try again
  s5 --> s7: you tap Continue without saving or the app is killed and opened again
  s6 --> s0: you reset onboarding (debug Settings)
  s7 --> s0: you reset onboarding (debug Settings)
  s2 --> s5: you skip the cat or you name the cat and tap Continue
  class s3 blue
  class s4 orange
  class s5 orange
  class s6 teal
  class s7 teal
